New:
• The lamp button switches with one tap between analyzing, playing against the computer and playing against a friend. While you play, no hints are shown.
• Menu and settings are tidied up and sorted into clear categories.

Improved:
• Moves, undo and redo no longer get lost, and a game is no longer restarted out of the blue.
• The board stays visible after jumping to an analyzed move.
• Board labels and evaluations stay readable on a rotated board.
